  "tables": [
    {
      "caption": "Coat of arms of University College Cork",
      "headers": [
        "Notes Granted on 27 March 1889 by Sir John Bernard Burke, Ulster King of Arms. Crest 1st an estoile Vert (Prior) 2nd a mullet per pale Or and Gules. Escutcheon Per pale Gules and Azure on the dexter side a lion statant guardant imperially crowned Or on the sinister side three eastern crowns Proper on a chief of the third an ancient ship between two castles in fess of the first in centre chief point of achievement an open book Argent garnished of the third. Motto Where Finbarr Taught Let Munster Learn [ 132 ]"
      ],
